         5,
         2
      ]
   },
   "worked_solution": [
      {
         "step": 1,
         "text": "For the ratio test, \\( \\left|\\frac{a_{n+1}}{a_n}\\right| = \\frac{4 \\left|{x}\\right|^{2}}{25} \\).",
         "mathjson": [
            "Divide",
            [
               "Multiply",
               4,
               [
                  "Power",
                  [
                     "Abs",
                     "x"
                  ],
                  2
               ]
            ],
            25
         ]
      },
      {
         "step": 2,
         "text": "As \\( n \\to \\infty \\), the limit of this ratio is \\( \\frac{4 \\left|{x}\\right|^{2}}{25} \\).",
         "mathjson": [
            "Divide",
            [
               "Multiply",
               4,
               [
                  "Power",
                  [
                     "Abs",
                     "x"
                  ],
                  2
               ]
            ],
            25
         ]
      },
      {
         "step": 3,
         "text": "The series converges when \\( \\frac{4 \\left|{x}\\right|^{2}}{25} < 1 \\), that is, when \\( \\left|x\\right| < \\frac{5}{2} \\).",
         "mathjson": [
            "Rational",
            5,
            2
         ]
      },
      {
         "step": 4,
         "text": "The radius of convergence is \\( R = \\frac{5}{2} \\).",
         "mathjson": [
            "Rational",
            5,
            2
         ]
      }
